# Line endings. The lab PC is Windows and development happens on macOS, so
# this is not theoretical: a shell script checked out with CRLF fails with an
# error that names the wrong thing entirely, and PowerShell wants CRLF.
* text=auto

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf

*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.svg  text
